# Peaclock — complete feature and command reference

Peaclock is a free, open-source terminal application by Octobanana. It is much more than a clock: it combines three timekeeping modes, five display views, extensive terminal styling, live keyboard controls, a built-in command prompt, configurable timers, shell-command execution, and persistent configuration.

