You don't have to type every color value manually. Select a style target using its keyboard shortcut, then adjust hue, saturation and luminosity using the mapped keys described in Section 3.

## 8. Configuration files and startup presets

Peaclock reads commands from a plain-text configuration file. This means you can make a personalized clock setup persistent across launches.

